The *.astc files in this directory are 128-bit blocks generated by tools/gen_random_vectors.py
from a fixed pseudo-random seed (random or randomly configured blocks, not compressor output; no
third-party content). The fnv1a64 column of vectors.tsv is the FNV-1a hash of the RGBA8 decoding of
each file made by the astcenc 5.7.1 release binary (https://github.com/ARM-software/astc-encoder,
licence Apache-2.0), run unmodified as a black box. The URL of the release zip and the sha256 of the
zip and of the binary are in ../../PROVENANCE.md.

No astcenc source code or binary is included here, and the licence text of the tool is not copied
here. Whether Apache-2.0 section 4 requires it to be shipped with output of this kind is an open
question for the maintainers (../../maintainer-question.md, item 13).
